[l_english.STATE_LORE_385]
In the northern reaches of the Changeling Empire lies Hatchburg, the empire’s largest barracks outside of the Insect Nests. Typically, insect eggs hatch best in warm, humid environments. However, if they can break through their shells at the foot of cold, dry, barren snowy mountains, what could stop them from becoming the empire’s finest warriors?
During the Changeling Kingdom’s metamorphosed period, the residents of Hatchburg were commanded by Thorax to migrate south due to the inhospitable environment. Yet, this didn’t lead to the fortress’s abandonment; instead, it made it even stronger. The southern migration filtered out the kind, gentle, and life-loving Changelings, leaving behind only those who refused to leave, refused to metamorph, and steadfastly defended the empire’s borders in the biting cold. When the Queen later returned, the remaining Changelings at Hatchburg became the first army to raise her banner and follow her; when armies marched to the distant Land of crystals and blizzards, the soldiers from Hatchburg became synonymous with security within the Changeling army.
The northern fortress, in its biting winds, finally received its reward. After weeding out the weak, the newly formed elite imperial units, and even the Empress’s guard, were almost entirely graduates of Hatchburg’s military academy. These young and vibrant Changeling faces often gathered in the wilderness, at the foot of the snow mountains, and in the north wind, discussing imperial politics, yearning to conquer the world, and awaiting their opportunity – though sometimes their remarks didn’t sound awefully respectful or loyal to the Queen herself.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_385]
在幻形灵帝国的北方边疆，坐落着帝国除虫巢外最大的兵营——孵化堡。通常，虫卵的孵化在温暖潮湿的环境最为适宜；然而，如果在寒冷干燥寸草不生的雪山脚下都能破壳而出，还有什么能阻止他们成为帝国最优秀的战士呢？
在幻形灵王国的化茧时期，因孵化堡的地理环境不宜生存，居民曾在索拉克斯的命令下向南迁移；但这不仅没让孵化堡废弃，反而让其更加坚固：南迁筛选掉了善良、温柔、热爱生活的幻形灵，只有那些拒绝离开、拒绝化茧、在寒风中坚守帝国边疆的幻形灵留了下来。后来女王回归之时，孵化堡的留守者成为了第一批举起大旗追随女王的军队；当军队开往遥远的水晶与风雪之国时，孵化堡的士兵也成为了幻形灵军队中安全感的代名词。
寒风中的北方堡垒最终迎来了属于它的奖赏，在筛选掉了那些软弱者后，新组建的帝国精锐部队，甚至是女皇的近卫部队，几乎全部毕业于孵化堡的军官学校。那些年轻而朝气蓬勃的幻形灵面孔，常常聚在一起，在荒原上、雪山麓、北风中，谈论着帝国政局、向往着征战世界，等待着属于他们的机会 —— 虽然有时他们的言论似乎并未足够体现对女王应有的忠诚与尊敬。
